# A job ad in Russian: требуется повар, умеющий…
subtitle: "Read a Russian job ad and write your own participles: уме́ют becomes уме́ющий, рабо́тал becomes рабо́тавший."
tags: ["russian","russian participles","job ad in russian","требуется","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/participles","vocabulary/work","phrases/formal-register"]
thumb: "band \"Read & write a Russian job ad\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Overslept in Russian: проспал, заснул, дочитал","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/154-russian-overslept.cast"}

## A job ad in Russian: требуется повар, умеющий…
