    '|a||A job ad in Russian: требуется повар, умеющий…':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5320
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Read a Russian job ad and write your own participles: уме́ют becomes уме́ющий, рабо́тал becomes рабо́тавший.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9360
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1yuyfn6'
    '|a||Апре́ль. I''m шеф at «Нева́» now, and Ди́ма is our су-ше́ф. So we need a new cook.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6920
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||I put an ad online. В пя́тницу звони́т Со́фья, a cook. Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5840
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:9lxrm2'
    '|b||Здра́вствуйте. Я звоню́ по объявле́нию. Вам тре́буется по́вар?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4720
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:hl5e4u'
    '|a||Да. Нам ну́жен по́вар, уме́ющий гото́вить ры́бу. У вас есть о́пыт?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4760
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Да, я три го́да рабо́тала в рестора́не в Каза́ни.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3480
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Хорошо́. Приходи́те на собесе́дование в понеде́льник в де́сять.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4920
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Спаси́бо! Обяза́тельно приду́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2560
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Why is Софья calling?':
