    '|a||When is Софья''s interview with Tom? (собесе́дование = interview)':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4800
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||В понеде́льник в де́сять.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2200
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Вот моё объявле́ние. Прочита́йте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2440
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Вака́нсия: по́вар.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2280
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:102q55p'
    '|a||Тре́буется отве́тственный по́вар, уме́ющий гото́вить ры́бу.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4320
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:4qg932'
    '|a||О́пыт — от двух лет. Гра́фик: два че́рез два.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5160
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:lqnlkk'
    '|a||Зарпла́та — се́мьдесят ты́сяч в ме́сяц.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3280
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1bepxoz'
    '|a||Ждём ва́ше резюме́! Рестора́н «Нева́».':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:257xf5'
    '|a||Тре́буется: is wanted. One cook: тре́буется. Two cooks: тре́буются.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1jtym9f'
    '|a||И вот: по́вар, уме́ющий гото́вить ры́бу. In lesson 125 you read these. Today you make them.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9160
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1uukbp1'
    '|a||Но́вые слова́: вака́нсия, гра́фик, зарпла́та, резюме́. И собесе́дование, отве́тственный. Повтори́те.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1p18ok4'
    '|a||Тре́буется по́вар. Тре́буются повара́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3160
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:thm86n'
    '|a||Уме́ть: to know how to. Я уме́ю, ты уме́ешь, они́ уме́ют.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6320
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:13mjcyv'
    '|a||Посмотри́те: from кото́рый to a participle.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4040
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:y8izmn'
    '|a||Кото́рый уме́ет. Take the они́-form, уме́ют, swap the т for щ, add an adjective ending: уме́ющий.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1aqib0m'
    '|a||Кото́рый зна́ет. Они́ зна́ют: зна́ющий.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4280
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:u9agrr'
    '|a||Кото́рый говори́т. Они́ говоря́т: говоря́щий. Ят gives ящий.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:jjkvmg'
    '|a||The past is easier still. For most verbs, swap л for вш: кото́рый рабо́тал, рабо́тавший.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9040
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1fnz2tm'
    '|a||Щ: now. Вш: before. Повтори́те: уме́ющий, зна́ющий, говоря́щий, рабо́тавший.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10160
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:r8bo19'
    '|a||По́вар, кото́рый уме́ет гото́вить. По́вар, уме́ющий гото́вить. The same meaning.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6520
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1913yck'
    '|a||In speech, Russians mostly say кото́рый. The participle is for writing: ads, letters, the news.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:16co7nb'
    '|a||The ending follows the noun, like но́вый. Нам ну́жен по́вар, уме́ющий гото́вить.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1uj0ug'
    '|a||Ни́на Петро́вна — сосе́дка, зна́ющая весь дом.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3920
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1xt4wha'
    '|a||Нам нужны́ лю́ди, уме́ющие рабо́тать.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3040
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1n2noas'
    '|a||Тепе́рь вы. Ру́сская ку́хня: Russian cooking.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4680
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1x8ulr3'
    '|a||Запо́лните про́пуски.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1600
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:dgfken'
    '|a||По́вар, зна́ющий ру́сскую ку́хню.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3000
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Официа́нт, говоря́щий по-англи́йски.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2560
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1q4snoy'
    '|a||Лю́ди, уме́ющие рабо́тать но́чью.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:192nmkc'
    '|a||Сосе́дка, рабо́тавшая в музе́е. Молоде́ц!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3360
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:10hh150'
    '|a||Напиши́те по-ру́сски, with a participle: a cook who knows Russian cuisine.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5600
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:uzgn80'
    '|a||Напиши́те, with a participle: a cook who knows Russian cuisine.':
