      ms: 5480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1lzpsnw'
    '|a||Пра́вильно! Зна́ют, зна́ющий.':
